@startuml
title Fund Management Flow - Queued Assets State Changes

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 3
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 250
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Monospaced"

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    BoxBorderColor #999999
    BoxBackgroundColor #F9F9F9
    GroupBorderColor #AAAAAA
    GroupBackgroundColor #EEEEEE
}

actor "Balance Sheet Manager" as BSM
participant Spoke
participant SnapshotQueue
participant PoolEscrow
participant "Hub" as Hub

note over Spoke, Hub
    Spoke → Hub communication
    routes through Messaging
end note

== Initial State ==
note over SnapshotQueue
    **Queued Assets:** 500 USDC deposits, 200 USDC withdrawals
    **Net Queued:** +300 USDC
end note

note over PoolEscrow
    **Available Balance:** 2000 USDC
end note

note over Hub
    **Holdings:** 5000 USDC
    **Issued Shares:** 10000 tokens
end note

== Deposit Operation ==
BSM -> Spoke: deposit(1000 USDC)
activate Spoke
Spoke -> PoolEscrow: transfer 1000 USDC from BSM
activate PoolEscrow
PoolEscrow --> PoolEscrow: availableBalance: 2000 → 3000 USDC
deactivate PoolEscrow
Spoke -> SnapshotQueue: queueAssets(+1000 USDC)
activate SnapshotQueue
SnapshotQueue --> SnapshotQueue: queuedDeposits: 500 → 1500 USDC
deactivate SnapshotQueue
deactivate Spoke

note over SnapshotQueue
    **Queued Assets:** 1500 USDC deposits, 200 USDC withdrawals
    **Net Queued:** +1300 USDC
end note

== Withdraw Operation ==
BSM -> Spoke: withdraw(800 USDC, to BSM)
activate Spoke
Spoke -> PoolEscrow: transfer 800 USDC to BSM
activate PoolEscrow
PoolEscrow --> PoolEscrow: availableBalance: 3000 → 2200 USDC
deactivate PoolEscrow
Spoke -> SnapshotQueue: queueAssets(-800 USDC)
activate SnapshotQueue
SnapshotQueue --> SnapshotQueue: queuedWithdrawals: 200 → 1000 USDC
deactivate SnapshotQueue
deactivate Spoke

note over SnapshotQueue
    **Queued Assets:** 1500 USDC deposits, 1000 USDC withdrawals
    **Net Queued:** +500 USDC
end note

== Submit Queued Assets ==
BSM -> Spoke: submitQueuedAssets()
activate Spoke
Spoke -> SnapshotQueue: flushAssets()
activate SnapshotQueue
SnapshotQueue --> SnapshotQueue: calculate net: +500 USDC, clear queues to zero
SnapshotQueue --> Spoke: UpdateData(+500 USDC)
deactivate SnapshotQueue
group Send snapshot to Hub
Spoke -> Hub: sendUpdateHoldingAmount(+500 USDC)
activate Hub
Hub -> Hub: holdings: 5000 → 5500 USDC
Hub -> Hub: update accounting with +500 USDC
deactivate Hub
end
deactivate Spoke

== Final State ==
note over SnapshotQueue
    **Queued Assets:** 0 USDC deposits, 0 USDC withdrawals
    **Net Queued:** 0 USDC
end note

note over PoolEscrow
    **Available Balance:** 2200 USDC
end note

note over Hub
    **Holdings:** 5500 USDC
    **Issued Shares:** 10000 tokens
end note

@enduml
